# PHONARA UI/UX — Presentation Layer

> **Phase D:** presentation deleted — engine boundary only · copy: [`COPYWRITING_CANON.md`](../../docs/SSOT/COPYWRITING_CANON.md)

## Engine boundary (money safety — non-negotiable)

- UI displays RPC/hook values only; never recompute payouts, PnL, liquidation, fees, or balances client-side.
- Engine/DB/RPC changes follow [`ENGINE_BOUNDARY.md`](../../docs/SSOT/ENGINE_BOUNDARY.md) + [`DEMOLITION_PLAN.md`](../../docs/PRODUCT/DEMOLITION_PLAN.md). When touching money paths: local `db reset` · SQL conservation Σ=0 · hash-chain · advisor 0 ERROR before "done".
- Single Supabase project lock: `yocjhjsdwoijfdrehzoq` only (`20-supabase-safety`).

## i18n — copy-only exception
- `packages/i18n`: add new keys/translations only
- No delete, rename, or meaning change of existing keys
- Tone: next-action focused; no apology copy in user-facing strings

## UI ↔ engine boundary
- Display RPC/hook values only; never recompute payouts, PnL, liquidation, fees
- Optimistic UI is display-only; server response is source of truth

## Funnel tone (Earn first, Trade last)
- Earn/Home sets product personality: low density, 48px+ touch, reward feedback
- Games/Casino: medium density, game surface motion
- Trade: high density, exchange grammar — isolated to Trade surface only

## Conversion surfaces (Earn/Home — SSOT aligned)

Per [`docs/SSOT/PRODUCT_PRINCIPLES.md`](../../docs/SSOT/PRODUCT_PRINCIPLES.md) · [`docs/SSOT/EARN_UX_CANON.md`](../../docs/SSOT/EARN_UX_CANON.md) · [`docs/SSOT/COPYWRITING_CANON.md`](../../docs/SSOT/COPYWRITING_CANON.md):

- **Allowed:** activity feeds · streaks · participation counters · social proof as **presentation string display props** (not engine/RPC/ledger mutations)
- **Allowed:** restrained FOMO on Earn/Home — countdowns · limited slots · season goals when copy is **truthful and eligibility-visible**
- **Forbidden:** exaggerated reward claims · false urgency · false deadlines · guaranteed-profit claims · deceptive social proof · hidden eligibility
- **Financial surfaces (Trade · Sports · Wallet · ledger):** guaranteed-profit claims · unbacked deposit/settlement copy **금지**

## Code hygiene
- Pre-demolition imported UI paths (`components/ui`, shell components, local CSS/motion,
  `presentation-import-tokens.css`) were deleted in v5 Demolition and are not active targets.
- Pre-demolition shared UI path `packages/ui` was deleted in v5 Demolition and must not be recreated before Phase R defines component ownership.
- Pre-demolition token path `apps/web/src/theme.css` was deleted in v5 Demolition. Phase R will define the new token SOT.
- Tabular nums for all money/quantity displays
- Domain safety states (kill switch, parity hold, withdrawal gate, KYC, RG limits) are first-class UI states

## Merge gates (presentation changes)
- `typecheck`, `build`, `check:i18n`, `check:release` must pass
- Existing parity/E2E/conservation tests must stay green
